<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised its rating on Cabletron Systems Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 62-5/8.</p>
</text>
